        "custom_liquid_PTHkRR": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  Ürün sayfasında Artikelnummer + EAN gösterir.\n  Artikelnummer = specs.article_number metafield; EAN = varyant barcode.\n  Xtra'da ürün sayfasına Custom Liquid bloğu olarak ekle (başlık/fiyat altına).\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign art = product.metafields.specs.article_number.value -%}\n{%- assign ean = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.barcode -%}\n{%- if art != blank or ean != blank -%}\n<div class=\"product-codes\" style=\"margin:10px 0;font-size:.9em;color:#555;\">\n  {%- if art != blank -%}<strong>Artikelnummer:</strong> {{ art }}{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if ean != blank -%}{% if art != blank %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {% endif %}<strong>EAN:</strong> {{ ean }}{%- endif -%}\n</div>\n{%- endif -%}"
          }
        },
